{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Wraps a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" so a transient failure to read entitlements never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presents a previously-seen paid user as free."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ResilientPaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ResilientPaywallService"}],"symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:13SwiduxPaywall09ResilientB7ServiceV","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPaywall"}],"role":"symbol","title":"ResilientPaywallService"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/currentSnapshot()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfo()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfoStream()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/restorePurchases()"],"generated":true}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ResilientPaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" populates "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallState","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — and therefore the feature gate,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"account display, and whether the paywall sheet is shown — entirely from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"snapshots its wrapped service emits. A slow, silent, or throwing entitlement"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read at cold launch leaves that state at its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"free"},{"type":"text","text":" default. This decorator"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps a persisted last-known-good so the gate never collapses to free on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transient failure, while the server remains the authoritative gate: a later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"live snapshot always overwrites the cache, so a genuine lapse is honoured."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The cache is bounded by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxCacheAge"},{"type":"text","text":" (72 hours by default): a stale cache"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stops vouching for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPro"},{"type":"text","text":" — subscriptions lapse, and an install that stays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offline past the bound must not keep pro forever — but keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"},{"type":"text","text":", because lifetime purchases don’t expire."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Provider-agnostic by construction — it speaks only ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService"},{"text":", so it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wraps any base (simulated, RevenueCat, StoreKit, …). Feed the wrapped instance","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"both","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin","type":"reference"},{"text":" and any app-side reader that builds a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"monetization\/context payload from entitlements.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Back the cache with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyValueStore"},{"type":"text","text":" rather than "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UserDefaults"},{"type":"text","text":": the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cache vouches for a paid entitlement offline, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UserDefaults"},{"type":"text","text":" is a plist"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a user can edit or restore from a doctored backup, whereas the Keychain is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encrypted and not plist-editable. (On unsigned macOS dev builds the Keychain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can return "},{"code":"errSecMissingEntitlement","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ −34018 — see "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Sandboxing &","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entitlements (macOS)","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyValueStore"},{"type":"text","text":".)"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let resilient = ResilientPaywallService(","    base: paywallService,","    store: KeychainKeyValueStore(service: \"com.example.myapp\")",")","\/\/ PaywallPlugin(..., service: resilient)   \/\/ gate + account display","\/\/ await resilient.currentSnapshot()        \/\/ server payload, off-main"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Threat-model","type":"heading","text":"Threat model"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Backed by "},{"code":"KeychainKeyValueStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", the cache defends against casual plist"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editing and a doctored-backup restore: the persisted last-known-good is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encrypted and not a user-editable file. It does "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" defend against a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"jailbroken device — nothing client-side does; entitlements can always be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forged on a device the attacker fully controls. The live provider stays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authoritative whenever the app is online: any live snapshot overwrites the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cache, so a genuine lapse or downgrade is honoured on the next successful"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read. "},{"code":"hasPermanentLicense","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" deliberately never expires — a lifetime purchase"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"must keep working offline indefinitely."}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/customerInfo()":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"customerInfo"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","text":"EntitlementSnapshot"}],"type":"topic","title":"customerInfo()","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfo()","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/customerinfo()","abstract":[{"text":"Fetches the current entitlement status, retrying up to ","type":"text"},{"code":"maxAttempts","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with exponential backoff. On success persists and returns; if every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attempt fails, returns the cached last-known-good when present and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"usable, otherwise rethrows (so the plugin’s honest ","type":"text"},{"code":".refreshFailed","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"path is preserved for a genuinely-unknown user). Cancellation stops","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"retrying immediately and falls through to the cache.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/currentSnapshot()":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Non-throwing read for callers that always want a snapshot, degrading to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"free only for a genuinely-unknown user. Convenient for building a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"per-request monetization context off the main actor."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"currentSnapshot"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","text":"EntitlementSnapshot"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/currentSnapshot()","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/currentsnapshot()","kind":"symbol","title":"currentSnapshot()"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/PaywallService":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PaywallService"}],"type":"topic","title":"PaywallService","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PaywallService"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/paywallservice","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Provider-agnostic paywall service protocol."}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/customerInfoStream()":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Long-lived stream of entitlement updates. Yields the persisted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"last-known-good first (when "},{"code":"seedsFromCache","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is on and the cache is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still usable), then forwards and persists every snapshot the base"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stream emits."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"customerInfoStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","text":"AsyncStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","text":"EntitlementSna